OL,3,GNEWSAPair face extradition to US over
OL,4,Acancer drug fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people could face extradition to
OL,7,Fthe United States after being accused
OL,8,Fof defrauding health programmes out of
OL,9,Fmillions of dollars by providing cancer
OL,10,Fdrugs not approved by a federal agency.
OL,12,FSukhi Ghuman, 48, of Syerston Hall near
OL,13,FNewark, and his ex-wife Kiranjit
OL,14,FGhuman, 48, are also being sought to
OL,15,Fstand trial in the US on separate drug
OL,16,Fsmuggling charges.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
