OL,3,GNEWSAPair face extradition to US over
OL,4,Acancer drug fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors on behalf of the US
OL,7,Fgovernment allege the pair told US
OL,8,Ffederal health insurance program
OL,9,FMedicare they were providing approved
OL,10,Fdrugs, but provided cheaper ones and
OL,11,Fmade profit on the difference.
OL,13,FThe extradition hearing at Westminster
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court is set to last five
OL,15,Fdays.
